Z||000000||NIFE [PaulV]||09-09-2001||11:46 PM||||The drawing for the 88GT plus 2nd & 3rd place took place at 4:30PM Chicago time today (Sunday), at the conclusion of a WET Fierorama 2001. (We still had 119 cars show up on a very rainy day)<BR>The winners are as follows:<P>88GT T-Top 5-speed<P>Carl Anderson<BR>Hoffman Estates IL<BR>Carl bought ticket # 08 on 4/21/01.<BR>He currently owns a 85SC.<P>Mr Mikes interior leather package<P>Chuck Rudolph<BR>Elgin, IL<BR>Chuck bought 5 tickets, #101-105 on 5/4/01<BR>He currently owns a 85GT<P><BR>Fiero Store $500.00 gift certificate.<P>Dave Gray (aka Monkeyman on Pennocks!)<BR>Wabash, IN<BR>Dave bought 2 tickets #459 & #460 on 7/5/01<BR>He currently owns a 86GT<P>Thanks to all our volunteers and door prize donations from Pep Boys, V8 Archie, Doug Kinney, Dave Kopielski, Darrell Morse, The Fiero Store & Bob Steiger at Twin Lakes Fiero .<P>The show was filmed by Bill Wilt's Motorsports Unlimited, a Regional Automotive oriented cable program. They tell us that when it is played and eventually repeated over a 24 month period, over 4 million viewers will see this show!<P>Paul Vargyas<BR>Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>||||reg||1
