Z||000007||Monkeyman||09-11-2001||05:46 AM||||While I appreciate the offer, I guess my answer had better be...NOT!!  I made my selections last night.  All I have to do is call them today so I can get my NIFE discount.  Here's a quick list of most of what I'll be ordering:  "FIERO GT" floor mats, coffee mug, leather shift knob, a couple of books, ultimate dog bone, all new switches, trunk weatherstrip, new center caps, plastic battery shield, and a windshield washer pump (never has worked and I don't know what's wrong--might as well start eliminating things).<P>I've never spent this much money and not spent any money (if you follow me).  It's like Christmas in September!  Thanx to NIFE for the raffle and the show.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
